{"id":"n14452-1-8","stage":3,"title":"뛰어내리다 · 跳下","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14452-1-8-1","ko":"자꾸 그렇게 바닥에 뛰어내리면 아랫집에서 시끄럽다고 올라온단 말이야.","zh":"你老是这样往地上跳，楼下会嫌吵找上来的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바닥에","meaning":"地板","explanation":"바닥：地板；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바닥","audio":"/audio/18c3f3f4b810aab6c28b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62696","senseId":"4","lemma":"바닥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뛰어내리면","meaning":"跳下，蹦下","explanation":"뛰어내리다：跳下，蹦下；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"뛰어내리다","audio":"/audio/42c1e817ea9c6ab62069.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14452","senseId":"2","lemma":"뛰어내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아랫집에서","meaning":"下家邻居","explanation":"아랫집：下家邻居；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"아랫집","audio":"/audio/553c5b006533f2da9b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66798","senseId":"1","lemma":"아랫집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시끄럽다고","meaning":"吵闹，喧嚣","explanation":"시끄럽다：吵闹，喧嚣；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"시끄럽다","audio":"/audio/72d1507eed9433fbf043.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15961","senseId":"1","lemma":"시끄럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올라온단","meaning":"上来，升至","explanation":"올라오다：上来，升至；ㄴ단：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"올라오다","audio":"/audio/3a939ba13b7d1af7902f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67841","senseId":"6","lemma":"올라오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말이야.","meaning":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","explanation":"말：表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"11","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"18c3f3f4b810aab6","term":"바닥","zh":"地板","audio":"/audio/18c3f3f4b810aab6c28b.mp3","entryId":"62696","definition":"建筑物内部的下面部分。","pronunciation":["바닥"]},{"id":"42c1e817ea9c6ab6","term":"뛰어내리다","zh":"跳下，蹦下","audio":"/audio/42c1e817ea9c6ab62069.mp3","entryId":"14452","definition":"从某个地方跃身脱离。","pronunciation":["뛰어내리다","뛰여내리다"]},{"id":"553c5b006533f2da","term":"아랫집","zh":"下家邻居","audio":"/audio/553c5b006533f2da9b27.mp3","entryId":"66798","definition":"在下方为邻或在低处的房子。","pronunciation":["아래찝","아랟찝"]},{"id":"72d1507eed9433fb","term":"시끄럽다","zh":"吵闹，喧嚣","audio":"/audio/72d1507eed9433fbf043.mp3","entryId":"15961","definition":"声音大而嘈杂，令人听起来厌烦。","pronunciation":["시끄럽따"]},{"id":"3a939ba13b7d1af7","term":"올라오다","zh":"上来，升至","audio":"/audio/3a939ba13b7d1af7902f.mp3","entryId":"67841","definition":"由下往上走。","pronunciation":["올라오다"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","pronunciation":["말ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/1febef0ab02a6709a1e3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14452-1-8-2","ko":"이제 그만 뛰어내릴게요.","zh":"我不跳了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그만","meaning":"就那样，到此为止","explanation":"그만：就那样，到此为止","readings":[{"term":"그만","audio":"/audio/38c09c96aa077d2721fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36428","senseId":"3","lemma":"그만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뛰어내릴게요.","meaning":"跳下，蹦下","explanation":"뛰어내리다：跳下，蹦下；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"뛰어내리다","audio":"/audio/42c1e817ea9c6ab62069.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14452","senseId":"2","lemma":"뛰어내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"说话的同时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"38c09c96aa077d27","term":"그만","zh":"就那样，到此为止","audio":"/audio/38c09c96aa077d2721fe.mp3","entryId":"36428","definition":"就做到那个程度。","pronunciation":["그만"]},{"id":"42c1e817ea9c6ab6","term":"뛰어내리다","zh":"跳下，蹦下","audio":"/audio/42c1e817ea9c6ab62069.mp3","entryId":"14452","definition":"从某个地方跃身脱离。","pronunciation":["뛰어내리다","뛰여내리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ea51106fbfe83cc216ea.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.76,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14452","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":118,"sequenceScore":3.2367,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我不跳了。","你老是这样往地上跳，楼下会嫌吵找上来的。","我正在考虑要不要换工作。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你老是这样往地上跳，楼下会嫌吵找上来的。","我正在考虑要不要换工作。","我不跳了。"],"answer":2}]}
